	\textbf{ii. The Second Isomoprhism Theorem:}\\
	For a group $G$ with, $A, B \leq G$ and, $A \trianglelefteq N_G(B)$.
Then $AB \leq G, \\ B\trianglelefteq AB, A \cap B \trianglelefteq A$ and, $AB/B \cong A/ A \cap B$\\
